Subject: Don't build libsfml-doc (its doxygen can't be installed in the ppc64 snapshot)

doxygen depends on libfmt10, which the debian-ports snapshot does not have, so the build
dependencies were unsatisfiable. libsfml-doc is Architecture: all and Debian's own copy of it
stays; the libraries are built unchanged.

diff --git a/debian/control b/debian/control
--- a/debian/control	2026-08-05 15:48:10.000000000 +0300
+++ b/debian/control	2026-10-26 01:10:28.773821475 +0200
@@ -26,7 +26,6 @@
  libxi-dev,
  libxrandr-dev,
  pkgconf,
-Build-Depends-Indep: doxygen
 Standards-Version: 4.7.4
 Homepage: https://www.sfml-dev.org/
 Vcs-Git: https://salsa.debian.org/games-team/libsfml.git
@@ -136,16 +135,3 @@
  Network facilities and supports GNU/Linux, MS Windows and Mac OS X.
  .
  The Window library provides basic utilities for creating and managing Windows.
-
